# Rust 103: Functions — Practice

Companion exercises for `03_functions_e.ipynb`. Every section mirrors the section of the same number in the example notebook, and there is one exercise for each of its demonstration cells, so a `**See**` reference lands on the exact code that shows the technique.

The checks at the bottom of each cell are the grader. Edit only the parts marked `TODO`; when a cell runs without panicking you will see an `Exercise N.M passed` line.
